# GitHub's Linguist does not know Firn. Without this file it would label a
# repository that is over 90 percent Firn as "Shell" or "Python", because
# those are the only extensions it recognises. Better no language bar than
# a wrong one.
*.fi linguist-language=Firn
*.fi -linguist-detectable
docs/** linguist-documentation
tools/** linguist-vendored
*.sh linguist-vendored
*.py linguist-vendored
assets/** linguist-vendored
vendor/** linguist-vendored
*.rs linguist-vendored
*.s linguist-vendored
*.S linguist-vendored
*.ld linguist-vendored
*.css linguist-vendored
*.js linguist-vendored
*.html linguist-documentation
vorlage/** linguist-vendored
